/P 113 0 R
/E (Skillbridge demonstrates the effective use of artificial intelligence in a service- based marketplace by connecting skilled workers with customers efficiently. Through AI-powered recommendations, location-based matching, sentiment- based feedback analysis, dynamic pricing, and secure face-recognition authentication, the platform offers a reliable, transparent, and smarter alternative to traditional service-matching systems.)
